Node ID=5 clan business
Text=<He sets the bowl down.> Clan. Yes. The bones have been saying so for a while and I have been pretending not to hear them, because a human in the clan is an untidy sort of omen. Ask, then. I will not charge you the tourist's price.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Tell me about your divination.
Go to node ID=30 Explanation

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Another time, shaman.
Go to node ID=90 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=6 the champion at the pool
Text=<For a long moment he does not answer, and the water in the bowl does not move either.> I knew. I have known since the bounty hunter stopped breathing, and I have not decided yet whether the clan should be glad. A human champion is a door left open, and doors are how weather gets in. <He inclines his head anyway.> Champion.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then read the weather, shaman, and tell me what comes through.
Go to node ID=30 Explanation

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Keep your omens. I have work.
Go to node ID=90 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=15 No Darsh
Text=We originally planned merely to ransom the human you call Darsh. If that were still the case, I would be happy to accept the gold and turn him over to you. As it is, events have decreed a different fate for him.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you mean, goblin?
Go to node ID=30 Explanation

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=If you won't acept gold, you'll have to accept steel!
Go to node ID=100 combat
Icon=Fight Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 Fortune Teller
Text=Yes, we are, but the art and science of divination is not as crass as your question implies. We are no mere 'fortune teller'. Rakeb is a master of many diverse forms of prognostication.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=How do you tell the future? Do you have a crystal ball?
Go to node ID=30 Explanation

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=How's this for telling the future? I see... it's getting clearer...clearer... I see my blade -- in your liver!
Go to node ID=100 Combat
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I'll let you get back to that. Sorry to interrupt.
Go to node ID=90 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 Explanation
Text=Our job is to tell the clan's future so that our khan may plan accordingly. We are specialists in batraquomancy and catoptromancy but lately we've had to expand our skills in anthropomancy due to a slight...complication.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Rakeb requires player to be sent by darsch
Reply Text=What does this have to do with Darsh?
Go to node ID=40 Divination Definitions
Action work in progress=if Sent by Darsh, show this one
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Tribal 80+
Reply Text=Frogs, mirrors and entrails. You read what the clan eats, what the clan sees and what the clan kills - and lately rather more of the third than a healthy camp should need.
Go to node ID=35 fellow practitioner
Icon=Speach Skill Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I don't speak Goblin. Could you explain that to me in a language I understand?
Go to node ID=40 Divination Definitions
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=35 fellow practitioner
Text=<Rakeb's eyes narrow, and for the first time he speaks without performance.> So. The soft-skin has held a scrying bowl. Then you know what it costs to read a thing that does not wish to be read, and you know why my hands shake. I will not insult a practitioner with the speech I keep for tourists.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then tell me plainly. What is the complication?
Go to node ID=40 Divination Definitions

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Keep your bowl, shaman. I have seen enough.
Go to node ID=90 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=40 Divination Definitions
Text=Ah, your kind is always so ill-educated. You should really speak to Grumdjum about that. Batraquomancy and catoptromancy are, respectively, the prediction of future events by observing the actions of frogs and by seeking visions in a mirror placed underwater.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Rakeb requires player to be sent by darsch
Reply Text=What does this lunacy have to do with Darsh? I grow increasingly impatient, goblin.
Go to node ID=45 More Definitions
Action work in progress=if Sent by Darsh, show this one
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I see. And Anthromancy?
Go to node ID=45 More Definitions

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You're crazy. That's how you tell the future? That sounds ridiculous.
Go to node ID=43 Crazy
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=43 Crazy
Text=A response typical of the ignorant. The combination of these two sciences has allowed our clan to survive for decades in the midst of these human lands. The famiy Anura, or frogs, possess keen insight into future events, and it is only by observing their motions underwater with a mirror that their wisdom becomes clear.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Of course. How... stupid of me. Please continue.
Go to node ID=45 More definitions

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You'll die for that remark!
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CGoToCombatAction
{
Enemy Name=$Trigger
}
Icon=Fight Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=45 More Definitions
Text=Lately, devil-creatures have prevented me from employing my usual techniques in the stream that runs through these woods. I have had to rely on my training in anthropomancy, the prediction of future events by studying human entrails. Very messy, and it's hard to hear the spirits, what with all of the screaming.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Rakeb requires player to be sent by darsch
Reply Text=I see, and I take it you plan on telling the future with Darsh's entrails, then?
